Secret-detection rule patterns
------------------------------
The regular-expression patterns in secret/rules.go are derived from publicly
documented credential formats. Where format conventions follow community
secret-scanning rule sets (e.g. gitleaks / betterleaks, MIT-licensed), those
projects are gratefully acknowledged. No rule files were copied verbatim.
